{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,7,7]],"date-time":"2026-07-07T02:13:45Z","timestamp":1783390425967,"version":"3.54.6"},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"European Mathematical Society - EMS - Publishing House GmbH","issue":"2","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["Rev. Mat. Iberoam."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2013,4,22]]},"abstract":"<jats:p>We construct the Atiyah classes of holomorphic vector bundles using (1,0)-connections and developing a Chern\u2013Weil type theory, allowing us to effectively compare Chern and Atiyah forms. Combining this point of view with the \u010cech\u2013Dolbeault cohomology, we prove several results about vanishing and localization of Atiyah classes, and give some applications. In particular, we prove a Bott type vanishing theorem for (not necessarily involutive) holomorphic distributions. As an example we also present an explicit computation of the residue of a singular distribution on the normal bundle of an invariant submanifold that arises from the Camacho\u2013Sad type localization.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.4171\/rmi\/730","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2013,4,22]],"date-time":"2013-04-22T21:39:30Z","timestamp":1366666770000},"page":"547-578","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":10,"title":["Localization of Atiyah classes"],"prefix":"10.4171","volume":"29","author":[{"given":"Marco","family":"Abate","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Universit\u00e0 di Pisa, Italy"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0003-0624-7752","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Filippo","family":"Bracci","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Universit\u00e0 di Roma 'Tor Vergata', Italy"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Tatsuo","family":"Suwa","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Hokkaido University, Sapporo, Japan"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Francesca","family":"Tovena","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Universit\u00e0 di Roma \u201cTor Vergata\u201d, Italy"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"2673","container-title":["Revista Matem\u00e1tica Iberoamericana"],"original-title":[],"link":[{"URL":"http:\/\/www.ems-ph.org\/fulltext\/10.4171\/RMI\/730","content-type":"unspecified","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"similarity-checking"}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2025,11,4]],"date-time":"2025-11-04T13:11:19Z","timestamp":1762261879000},"score":1,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/ems.press\/doi\/10.4171\/rmi\/730"}},"subtitle":[],"short-title":[],"issued":{"date-parts":[[2013,4,22]]},"references-count":0,"journal-issue":{"issue":"2"},"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.4171\/rmi\/730","relation":{},"ISSN":["0213-2230","2235-0616"],"issn-type":[{"value":"0213-2230","type":"print"},{"value":"2235-0616","type":"electronic"}],"subject":[],"published":{"date-parts":[[2013,4,22]]}}}